### 测试后端API - deeplink-sso-appa (SSO Flow)

### 1. 注册新用户
POST http://localhost:3005/api/app/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 2. 登录用户 (只验证用户名密码,不调用CareVoiceOS)
POST http://localhost:3005/api/app/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### 3. 生成SSO Deeplink (返回authorization code)
# 这个接口模拟 IdP 生成授权码
POST http://localhost:3005/api/app/auth/deeplink
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@example.com"
}

### 4. 交换Token (APP B的后端会调用这个接口)
# 使用上一步返回的 authorizationCode
POST http://localhost:3005/api/app/auth/exchange-token
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "auth_code_xxxxx"
}

### 5. 健康检查
GET http://localhost:3005/api/app/health
